==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 5.33~16 seconds<sup>160f~480f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 9.33~28 seconds<sup>280f~840f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16~20 seconds<sup>480f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**9 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], this stage becomes monumentally easier, as his [[Resistant|resistance]] to Angels gives him incredible HP against the Angelic Gories. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] doesn't outrange King's Mimic, but it can get in a few hits in before getting killed, making the Angelic Gories that much easier. Once the four Angelic Gories are down, this stage is essentially won.

